WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.831
Today we will use evidence to discuss a performance. Our work connects with

00:00:04.831 --> 00:00:07.325
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.739
Watch or listen carefully without interrupting.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.485
Record one strength in timing, expression or teamwork.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:21.727
Suggest one useful change and say how to rehearse it. Justify a revision using

00:00:21.727 --> 00:00:23.641
evidence from another world tradition.
